+ * Dynamic Watch Face Canvas Texture Generator
+ * Renders 2D watch faces (Minimal, Neon, Chrono, Health) and simulated smart widgets
+ * onto an offscreen canvas mapped as a Three.js CanvasTexture.
+ */
+
